{"seq":3,"slug":"annotation-cost-optimize","title":"标注成本优化与外包策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relevance-crowdsourcing-label/label-throughput-cost/annotation-cost-optimize","wordCount":3014,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"标注成本优化与外包策略\">标注成本优化与外包策略</h1><p>「标注成本高」这句话在管理会上被说出来时，通常没有人知道它具体指什么。是每条任务的单价高？是标了很多最后没用上的数据？是质检花掉的人力比标注本身还多？还是重标率太高，等于每条数据付了两次钱？这些是完全不同的问题，需要完全不同的解法，而它们都被塞进了「成本高」这一个词里。成本优化的第一步不是省钱，是<strong>把成本拆开算清楚</strong>——算清了才会发现，通常最大的开销不在单价上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-单位成本是一个乘积-不是一个价格\">核心概念：单位成本是一个乘积，不是一个价格</h2><h3 id=\"单位成本恒等式\">单位成本恒等式</h3><p>单条标注的完整成本可以写成一个恒等式，这个恒等式是整个成本优化的地图：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>unit</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>task</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>qa</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>arb</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>prelabel_gain</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{unit}} = \\frac{p_{\\text{task}} \\cdot (1 + r_{\\text{rework}}) \\cdot (1 + r_{\\text{qa}}) \\cdot (1 + r_{\\text{arb}}) \\cdot (1 + r_{\\text{overhead}})}{1 - r_{\\text{prelabel\\_gain}} \\cdot \\eta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.48em;vertical-align:-1.053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prelabel_gain</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">task</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">qa</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">arb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>task</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{task}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">task</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是标注单条的直接单价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{rework}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是重标率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>qa</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{qa}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">qa</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是质检人力相对标注人力的比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>arb</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{arb}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">arb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是仲裁人力比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{overhead}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是平台与管理的开销比例，分母里的项表示预标注带来的效率折减（预标注机制见 <a href=\"model-prelabel-assisted\">模型预标注辅助提效</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[单位成本 c_unit] --&gt; B[直接单价 p_task]&#10;  A --&gt; C[重标率 r_rework]&#10;  A --&gt; D[质检人力 r_qa]&#10;  A --&gt; E[仲裁人力 r_arb]&#10;  A --&gt; F[管理开销 r_overhead]&#10;  A --&gt; G[预标注收益]&#10;  B --&gt; H[优化路径: 优先动系数]&#10;  C --&gt; H&#10;  D --&gt; H&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[任务成熟度阶梯]&#10;  I --&gt; J[内部 → 供应商 → 众包 → 预标注确认]\">graph TD\n  A[单位成本 c_unit] --&gt; B[直接单价 p_task]\n  A --&gt; C[重标率 r_rework]\n  A --&gt; D[质检人力 r_qa]\n  A --&gt; E[仲裁人力 r_arb]\n  A --&gt; F[管理开销 r_overhead]\n  A --&gt; G[预标注收益]\n  B --&gt; H[优化路径: 优先动系数]\n  C --&gt; H\n  D --&gt; H\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[任务成熟度阶梯]\n  I --&gt; J[内部 → 供应商 → 众包 → 预标注确认]</pre><p>这个式子的价值在于它把注意力从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>task</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{task}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">task</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 移开。在很多真实项目里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>task</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{task}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">task</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只占单位成本的三到五成，剩下的都在系数里。举一个典型例子：单价 0.5 元、重标率 15%、质检人力是标注人力的 30%、仲裁 8%、管理开销 25%，那么</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>unit</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.30</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.08</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.25</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.01</mn><mtext> 元</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{unit}} = 0.5 \\times 1.15 \\times 1.30 \\times 1.08 \\times 1.25 \\approx 1.01\\ \\text{元}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.08</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.01</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">元</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>单价砍 20% 能把成本降到 0.90 元，而把重标率从 15% 降到 5% 就能降到 0.94 元——两者的量级相当，但后者不伤害标注员的积极性，也不会推高流失。<strong>成本优化应当优先动系数，而不是动单价</strong>，这是这一篇最重要的结论。</p>\n<h3 id=\"各项系数的占比与副作用\">各项系数的占比与副作用</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>占比典型范围</th>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>主要副作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接单价</td>\n<td>30% - 55%</td>\n<td>难度定价精细化、人力来源切换</td>\n<td>降低会推高流失、降低接单意愿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重标率</td>\n<td>5% - 20%</td>\n<td>改善指南、提高准入、分发难度校正</td>\n<td>过度提高门槛会减少可用人力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质检人力</td>\n<td>20% - 40%</td>\n<td>风险分层抽检、金标题替代部分抽检</td>\n<td>覆盖不足 → 质量不可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仲裁人力</td>\n<td>3% - 10%</td>\n<td>指南修订减少分歧、加权投票前置</td>\n<td>指南修订有周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管理开销</td>\n<td>15% - 30%</td>\n<td>自动化结算与看板、减少人工协调</td>\n<td>前期投入大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预标注收益</td>\n<td>−10% - −50%</td>\n<td>提高覆盖率、模型迭代</td>\n<td>引入锚定偏差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个恒等式可以直接落成一条查询：把分母（已验收合格条数）与分子（这一批投入的全部人力与开销）分开聚合，每一个系数都能被单独观察，于是「这个月成本涨了」可以被拆成「重标率涨了」或「仲裁人力涨了」这类具体结论。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>unit_cost</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>label_payout</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>qa_cost</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>arb_cost</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>overhead</mtext></mrow><mtext>accepted_items</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{unit\\_cost} = \\frac{\\text{label\\_payout} + \\text{qa\\_cost} + \\text{arb\\_cost} + \\text{overhead}}{\\text{accepted\\_items}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unit_cost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3904em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accepted_items</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">label_payout</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qa_cost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">arb_cost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT b.batch_id,&#10;       b.market,&#10;       sum(l.payout_amount)                                    AS label_payout,&#10;       sum(q.hours) * $1                                       AS qa_cost,&#10;       sum(a.hours) * $1                                       AS arb_cost,&#10;       sum(l.payout_amount) * b.overhead_rate                  AS overhead,&#10;       count(DISTINCT j.judgment_id) FILTER (WHERE j.accepted)  AS accepted_items,&#10;       (sum(l.payout_amount)&#10;        + sum(q.hours) * $1&#10;        + sum(a.hours) * $1&#10;        + sum(l.payout_amount) * b.overhead_rate)&#10;         / greatest(count(DISTINCT j.judgment_id)&#10;                    FILTER (WHERE j.accepted), 1)              AS unit_cost&#10;FROM batches b&#10;JOIN payout_ledger l ON l.batch_id = b.batch_id&#10;LEFT JOIN qa_hours q ON q.batch_id = b.batch_id&#10;LEFT JOIN arb_hours a ON a.batch_id = b.batch_id&#10;JOIN judgments j      ON j.batch_id = b.batch_id&#10;WHERE b.closed_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY b.batch_id, b.market, b.overhead_rate&#10;ORDER BY unit_cost DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">payout_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> label_payout,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hours</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                       AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qa_cost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hours</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                       AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arb_cost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">payout_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">overhead_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> overhead,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> j</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">judgment_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> j</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">accepted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accepted_items,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">payout_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hours</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hours</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">payout_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">overhead_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> greatest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> j</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">judgment_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> j</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">accepted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> batches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payout_ledger l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qa_hours q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arb_hours a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> judgments j      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> j</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closed_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">overhead_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意分母用的是 <code>accepted</code> 而不是全部提交：这正是前一节强调的「单位有效成本」。如果换成全部提交条数，降本会变成把成本转移给下游——数据被丢弃的那部分在成本表上凭空消失了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"人力来源-内部-供应商与众包的边界\">人力来源：内部、供应商与众包的边界</h2><h3 id=\"三种来源的成本结构\">三种来源的成本结构</h3><p>标注人力有三种来源，它们的成本结构截然不同，适合的任务也不同。</p>\n<p><strong>内部标注团队</strong>成本最高（有雇佣成本、管理成本、工位成本），但它有三个不可替代的优势：口径最一致（同处一个组织，能被直接培训与对齐）、保密性最好（能处理未发布的模型输出、敏感数据）、以及能承担最主观的任务（需要业务理解的判断）。因此内部团队应当被保留给<strong>最难的、最敏感的、以及对口径有定义作用的那部分任务</strong>——包括仲裁与指南制定（见 <a href=\"../quality-arbitration/disagreement-arbitration\">分歧仲裁专家判定</a>）。把内部团队用于大规模常规标注是巨大的浪费。</p>\n<p><strong>供应商</strong>（外包公司）的成本介于两者之间，优势在于能提供稳定、可承诺的产能，有管理层次（供应商自己承担一线管理），适合<strong>有明确规格、有稳定量的批次任务</strong>。它的风险是质量依赖供应商的自身管理水平，且人员流动时质量会出现集体波动（同一批人换了，质量一起变）。对供应商的验收必须基于抽检数据而不是承诺，并且要能追溯到具体的人，否则无法定位问题。</p>\n<p><strong>众包平台</strong>成本最低、弹性最好，适合<strong>量大、规格清晰、可拆细、质量可被机器检验或高效抽检</strong>的任务。它的弱点正是本篇前几章反复讨论的那些：人员流动、质量方差大、需要一套完整的准入-定价-质检体系才能用（这套体系的成本是固定投入，只有规模足够大才摊得薄）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>相对成本</th>\n<th>产能弹性</th>\n<th>质量方差</th>\n<th>保密性</th>\n<th>最适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部团队</td>\n<td>高（3-5×）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>仲裁、指南、敏感数据、最主观任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商</td>\n<td>中（1.5-2.5×）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大批量规格明确任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>众包平台</td>\n<td>低（1×）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>海量常规任务、可抽检验收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>边界不是固定的，应当随任务的可规格化程度移动。</strong> 一个起初需要内部团队的新品类（指南未成熟、口径未对齐），随着指南沉淀与模型成熟，会逐步变得可以外包、再变得可以众包，最后变得可以预标注批量确认。这条「任务成熟度阶梯」是成本优化的主线：<strong>每一级成熟度对应一种更廉价的人力来源</strong>，而推动任务向上移动的手段是沉淀指南、提高模型准确率、以及细化质检规格。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自营-外包-众包的决策矩阵\">自营/外包/众包的决策矩阵</h3><p>选择来源的依据不是成本高低，而是任务的可规格化程度与质量可验证性。这两个维度决定了一旦出现质量问题，平台能不能低成本地发现并纠正——如果能，就可以用更廉价的人力；如果不能，省下的钱会以不可见的质量损失形式还回来。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可规格化程度</th>\n<th>质量可验证性</th>\n<th>建议来源</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>内部团队</td>\n<td>口径未定，只有内部能同时定义并执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>内部 + 供应商</td>\n<td>判定主观但可抽检验证，适合小规模外扩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>内部团队</td>\n<td>规格清晰但无法验证，外包等于放弃质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>众包</td>\n<td>量大、可拆细、抽检即可验收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>模型预标注</td>\n<td>已收敛的任务，人工只做抽样确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>右下角这一格是成本优化的终点：任务被完全规格化、质量可被机器或极低抽样率验证，人力成本趋近于零。推动任务向这一格移动的，是前三章积累的指南、金标题与质检数据——这也是为什么成本优化不能只在成本侧做。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见降本手段与它们的失效条件\">常见降本手段与它们的失效条件</h2><h3 id=\"手段按风险排序\">手段按风险排序</h3><p>降本手段本身没有对错，关键在于它是动了系数还是动了底线。下面这张表把常见手段按风险排序。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>动的成本项</th>\n<th>有效条件</th>\n<th>失效症状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提高预标注覆盖</td>\n<td>预标注收益</td>\n<td>模型准确率高、有对照组</td>\n<td>一致性虚高、模型自我确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>难度定价精细化</td>\n<td>直接单价（结构性）</td>\n<td>难度分可信</td>\n<td>难度分被操纵、难任务仍积压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险分层抽检</td>\n<td>质检人力</td>\n<td>风险分层特征有效</td>\n<td>低风险区成为盲区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指南细化</td>\n<td>重标率 + 仲裁</td>\n<td>有分歧数据支撑</td>\n<td>指南膨胀、标注员不再读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增加双标</td>\n<td>重标率（先升后降）</td>\n<td>分歧集中的任务类型</td>\n<td>成本上升而无质量收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降低抽检比例</td>\n<td>质检人力</td>\n<td>不得低于契约下限</td>\n<td>质量不可见、契约违约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压低单价</td>\n<td>直接单价</td>\n<td>市场供给充裕</td>\n<td>高质量标注员流失、质量长期下滑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是唯一一条<strong>必定有害</strong>的手段：压低单价在短期有效（因为众包供给充足时人不会立刻走），但它筛选出的正是对价格最敏感、对质量最不敏感的那部分人。它的效果会延迟数周到数月才显现，届时质量下滑的原因会被归因到别处（「最近这批人不行」），而真实原因是那次降价。这也是为什么计件单价在所有参数里最应该被保护（定价的完整讨论见 <a href=\"../labeler-management/labeler-capacity-payment\">产能管理与计件付费</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用实验代替争论\">用实验代替争论</h2><h3 id=\"分批次实验与对照\">分批次实验与对照</h3><p>成本优化最容易陷入的困境是各方的直觉冲突：运营认为单价必须降，质量负责人认为抽检不能减，算法团队认为预标注可以覆盖更多。这类争论无法用开会解决，但可以用<strong>分批次实验</strong>解决。</p>\n<p>可行的做法是把同一类任务拆成多个批次，对每个批次应用不同的成本策略组合（例如 A 批次维持现状、B 批次提高预标注覆盖、C 批次提高准入门槛），然后用统一的口径度量每个批次的<strong>单位有效成本</strong>——即最终被验收合格的单条成本，而不是提交成本。这个指标自然把质量纳入了分母。度量周期必须足够长，因为质量与流失的变化都有滞后（这也是为什么用「本周省了多少钱」作为评估标准是有害的）。</p>\n<p>实验设计上有两个必须守住的约束。第一，<strong>对照批次必须保留</strong>：没有对照，任何变化都会被归因到最近一次干预上，而真实原因可能是季节性或人力供给变化。第二，<strong>评估指标必须是下游可用的数据量</strong>：如果一批数据因为质量不合格最终被丢弃，那么它在成本表上也应当被完全计价，否则降本就成了把成本从标注转嫁给下游。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>单位成本是乘积而非单价；多数项目中直接单价只占三到五成，优化应优先动系数。</li>\n<li>三种人力来源的成本结构不同，内部保留给仲裁与指南、供应商承接规格明确的大批量、众包承接海量可抽检任务。</li>\n<li>任务成熟度阶梯是成本优化主线：指南沉淀与模型成熟让任务向更廉价的人力来源移动。</li>\n<li>压低单价是唯一必定有害的手段，其质量后果有数周到数月的延迟，因此最容易被误归因。</li>\n<li>成本实验必须保留对照批次，并以「单位有效成本」（含质量分母）而非「本周省了多少钱」评估。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>四章到此闭合：任务分发决定成本基线，人员管理决定单价，质检决定有效产出折扣，本章把三者乘起来并给出优化路径。回到 <a href=\"../\">hub 引言</a> 可以看到这四章之间的完整依赖关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"标注成本优化与外包策略","id":"标注成本优化与外包策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：单位成本是一个乘积，不是一个价格","id":"核心概念-单位成本是一个乘积-不是一个价格"},{"level":3,"text":"单位成本恒等式","id":"单位成本恒等式"},{"level":3,"text":"各项系数的占比与副作用","id":"各项系数的占比与副作用"},{"level":2,"text":"人力来源：内部、供应商与众包的边界","id":"人力来源-内部-供应商与众包的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"三种来源的成本结构","id":"三种来源的成本结构"},{"level":3,"text":"自营/外包/众包的决策矩阵","id":"自营-外包-众包的决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"常见降本手段与它们的失效条件","id":"常见降本手段与它们的失效条件"},{"level":3,"text":"手段按风险排序","id":"手段按风险排序"},{"level":2,"text":"用实验代替争论","id":"用实验代替争论"},{"level":3,"text":"分批次实验与对照","id":"分批次实验与对照"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模型预标注辅助提效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relevance-crowdsourcing-label/label-throughput-cost/model-prelabel-assisted"},"next":null}